## Third-party material

**`src/core/game-opening.mjs`** adapts YaKyoLife's seeded RNG, character creation,
ability tables and first-year dice/genius rules from `src/core/rng.js`,
`src/core/state.js`, `src/data/abilities.js` and `src/flow/phases.js`:
https://github.com/LeoGGcat/yakyulife/tree/9b17859dacaa40110a9d3774e6f11f419881f308
(v2.0.11, copyright 2026 最先生 / LeoGGcat, CC BY-NC 4.0).
Changes isolate the RNG per evaluation, retain only opening state, and return
initial/final snapshots instead of running the game's UI and career flow.
The same attribution applies to this code embedded in generated `index.html`.

**`src/core/engine.mjs`** is a new implementation of the application interface
and reference metrics. Its mathematical score weights and route thresholds retain
the historical Meshthings scale for data compatibility; they are not official game
rules. The former extracted Meshthings program and recommendation prose have been
replaced. See `docs/engine.md` for the specification and verification scope.

**`src/sim/career.mjs`** adapts the play-style archetypes and point-allocation
policies from `tools/sim-twoway.mjs` in the YaKyoLife source
(https://github.com/LeoGGcat/yakyulife, © LeoGGcat, CC BY-NC 4.0). The
adaptation is attributed in the file header and kept close to the original so
results stay comparable with the author's calibration.

## Not distributed here

**The full game copy** is never committed to this repository. `node cli.mjs sim`
and `node cli.mjs game update` clone it into `data/game/` on your machine, and
`data/` is gitignored. The game remains under its own CC BY-NC 4.0 license.

**`data/seeds.db`** and any simulation results in it are generated on your
machine and are not part of this repository.

**Historical commits:** older revisions include the extracted Meshthings program
under its original author's terms. This license does not grant rights to that
historical material; replacing the current files does not erase Git history.
